Package: ophcrack
Version: 3.8.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: clang, make, pkg-config, openssl, build-essential, sed, curl, tar, bzip2
Section: security
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://ophcrack.sourceforge.io/
Description: NTLM/LM hash cracker using rainbow tables
 Ophcrack is a free Windows password cracker based on the faster
 time-memory trade-off using rainbow tables. It cracks NTLM and LM
 hashes found in Windows SAM databases, works with pwdump format input
 files and supports brute force as well as rainbow table attacks.
